<main class="landing"><section class="landing-hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Find your direction, not another overwhelming list of ideas</p><h1>Stop guessing what kind of business you should start.</h1><p class="hero-description">You want to build a business. But with so many possibilities, how are you supposed to know which one is right for you? Take the free Business Direction Quiz to discover which business models fit your time, budget, goals, and the way you actually want to work.</p><a class="button primary-cta" href="/quiz">Find My Business Model →</a><p class="hero-note">Free quiz · Takes a few minutes · Find your starting direction</p></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="/media/hero" alt="Explore different business possibilities and find the direction that fits you" width="900" height="780" decoding="async" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.classList.add('hero-image-missing')" /><p class="hero-image-fallback">Your next business direction starts here.</p></div></section><section class="landing-details"><h2>Every business idea sounds possible. Until you have to choose one.</h2><p>You don't need another endless list of ideas. You need a way to narrow them down based on your real life and priorities.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/quiz">Take the free quiz →</a></section></main>
